{"id":"ba1b086fe1d56f25","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-sequent-validity.md","title":"相继式的赋值语义与有效性","display":"df-sequent-validity — 相继式的赋值语义与有效性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-sequent-validity","aliases":["72-df-sequent-validity"],"display":"df-sequent-validity — 相继式的赋值语义与有效性","depends_on":["[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.3.1–2.3.7, print31–34/PDF43–46; explicit semantic encoding","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local well-definedness argument recorded","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-sequent-validity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-sequent-validity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sequent-validity — 相继式的赋值语义与有效性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.3.1–2.3.7, print31–34/PDF43–46; explicit semantic encoding"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local well-definedness argument recorded"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\">\\(q=\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in D^V\">\\(s\\in D^V\\)</span>；对象公式满足关系沿用该定义。对全部结构的量化为ZFC公式，不把结构全体作为集合参数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{\\rm seq}\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\bigl[(\\forall i&lt;|\\Gamma|\\ \\mathfrak M,s\\models\\Gamma_i)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ (\\exists j&lt;|\\Delta|\\ \\mathfrak M,s\\models\\Delta_j)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\rm seq}q&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall s\\in D^V\\ (\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{\\rm seq}q),\\\\\n\\mathcal V_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)&amp;:=\\{q\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma):\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\rm seq}q\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(q)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\mathfrak M\\ (\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathfrak M\\models_{\\rm seq}q),\\\\\n\\mathcal V_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{q\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma):\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(q)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{\\rm seq}\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\bigl[(\\forall i&lt;|\\Gamma|\\ \\mathfrak M,s\\models\\Gamma_i)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ (\\exists j&lt;|\\Delta|\\ \\mathfrak M,s\\models\\Delta_j)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\rm seq}q&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall s\\in D^V\\ (\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{\\rm seq}q),\\\\\n\\mathcal V_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)&amp;:=\\{q\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma):\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\rm seq}q\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(q)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\mathfrak M\\ (\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathfrak M\\models_{\\rm seq}q),\\\\\n\\mathcal V_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{q\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma):\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(q)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空前件为真合取，空后件为假析取，因此空相继式在任何非空结构下均不满足。序列的次序与重复保留在句法中；语义按显示的全称、存在索引计算。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathcal V_\\Sigma\\)</span> 由既有集合上的分离得到，不需要“所有结构的集合”。本语义将等式原子解释为身份；纯LK没有等号公理，故这里只为可靠性提供语义，不直接断言相应完备性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)$、$\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma$ 取 [[72-df-sequent-calculus]]；$q=\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle$ 满足 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]] 的 $\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma$，$s\\in D^V$；对象公式满足关系沿用该定义。对全部结构的量化为ZFC公式，不把结构全体作为集合参数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"q=\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in D^V","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{\\rm seq}\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\bigl[(\\forall i<|\\Gamma|\\ \\mathfrak M,s\\models\\Gamma_i)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ (\\exists j<|\\Delta|\\ \\mathfrak M,s\\models\\Delta_j)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\rm seq}q&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall s\\in D^V\\ (\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{\\rm seq}q),\\\\\n\\mathcal V_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)&:=\\{q\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma):\\mathfrak M\\models_{\\rm seq}q\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(q)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\mathfrak M\\ (\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathfrak M\\models_{\\rm seq}q),\\\\\n\\mathcal V_\\Sigma&:=\\{q\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma):\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(q)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal V_\\Sigma","display":false}],"bytes":2382,"backlinks":[{"id":"7f1b713b3ea26325","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-459","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-validity|df-sequent-validity — 相继式的赋值语义与有效性]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-431","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-validity]]"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"相继式语义：[[72-df-sequent-validity]]"},{"id":"67654043764cc31b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"Σ 仅有一元关系 P、无常元和函数；$\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\{0,1\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle P,\\{\\langle0\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\}\\rangle$。$\\eta$ 将全部对象变量赋为0，$x:=v_1,y:=v_0$。Eigen 与相继式语义取 [[72-df-eigenvariable]]、[[72-df-sequent-validity]]。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-189","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-validity|df-sequent-validity — 相继式的赋值语义与有效性]]"},{"id":"edf9ec90faf33353","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)$；$\\mathcal V_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)$ 取 [[72-df-sequent-validity]]。$\\operatorname{Sound}$ 使用 [[72-df-abstract-rule-validity]] 的实例集合定义。"},{"id":"a1888eb7039fadfa","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma$ 取 [[72-df-sequent-validity]]，没有增加非逻辑初始式或算术归纳规则。"},{"id":"63b6af1fd7cf6609","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma_1,\\Gamma_2,\\Delta_1,\\Delta_2$ 为 Σ 上有限公式序列；串接、单元素序列与 $\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma$ 取 [[72-df-sequent-validity]]。voc 取 [[72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary]]。"},{"i